# Grounded Visit Note

Read [docs/PLAN.md](docs/PLAN.md) before changing architecture. Brief and transcripts are under `docs/`.

- Parse graph (LangGraph) → `features.json` only. Stitcher (no LLM) → SOAP `note.json`.
- `verify_quotes` grounds quotes in the file and owns line numbers. `reason` is not evidence.
- UI shows a SOAP note plus transcript, not parse internals.
- Implement **backend orchestration first**. Do not commit `.env`.
